        "loc_crescent_moon_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lady Cold Ash kills her with a grey light and draws her soul into a sleeve, noting that a rank eight Gu Immortal’s soul is more effective and easier to absorb when devouring. Xiao He Jian claims the soul for alliance leader Wu Shuai, and Lady Cold Ash hands it over.",
